<title>INDIA: INDIAN MAY FERTILISER OUTPUT RISES.</title>
<headline>INDIAN MAY FERTILISER OUTPUT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's nitrogenous fertiliser production rose in May compared with the same month last year, the government said in a monthly economic report.</p>
<p>    FERTILISER OUTPUT  May 1997    May 1996    April-May</p>
<p>							    1997/98  1996/97</p>
<p>    Nitrogenous	    734.8	 577.9    1,447.2  1,069.3</p>
<p>    Phosphatic	     234.7	 164.4	457.1   329.1</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary.</p>
</text>
